# One variable, and it is the only one anything reads:
# `components/map.tsx:30` passes it to MapLibre as the style URL. Empty means
# the app uses its built-in fallback style, `https://tiles.openfreemap.org/styles/bright`.
#
# The nine variables this file used to list (Supabase, OpenAI, routing, geocoding,
# weather, YouTube) were read by nothing. There is no backend, no model in the
# runtime, and no key-gated service. See `docs/03-technical/ARCHITECTURE-ACTUAL.md`.
NEXT_PUBLIC_MAP_STYLE_URL=
